# my opens the Node type picker; choosing Task, Project and Make Section converts three blocks.
file <<END
Packing:
	Clothes
	- Socks
	Shoes
END
keys j my
see Node type:
type task
keys <Enter>
keys j my
type proj
keys <Enter>
keys j my
type make
keys <Enter>
quit
saved <<END
Packing:
	- Clothes
	Socks:
	Shoes @section
END
